                                          "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                                          "args": {
                                            "text": [
                                              "Moxie signs: Stops\nare named, signal\ncards posted,\nbackup copies",
                                              "ready. If I miss a\nhandoff, Pip gets\nthe truth. She\nadds that the",
                                              "sled runner now\nturns without\neditorial comment,\nthen crosses out",
                                              "now to avoid\ntempting fate."
                                            ],
